The Approval Flow allows authorized participants to review and approve pending payment transactions before they proceed to interbank settlement.
Each transaction must be approved by both the Credit Agent and the Debtor Agent to be finalized.

The list displays all pending transactions awaiting approval.

Click the Select checkbox corresponding to the transaction you want to approve.

Click Approve to confirm the transaction.

Approval is not completed with a single confirmation.
	•	The transaction must be approved by both parties:
	•	Credit Agent
	•	Correspondent Agent